y_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"uJITgt5t7j-KpDChsXPV5w","review_id":"FLc3o1hr3cczLBLgxGH-Cw","date":"2015-05-27T03:23:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9307162761688232,"text_excerpt":"I work right across the street and I'm so happy I discovered this place. I love going here to grab a quick coffee or lunch. Service is friendly and fast and prices are very reasonable, especially for being in the CBD. Their menu has a really good selection of sandwiches, soups and salads. I usually opt for a half sandwich and soup combo and have never been disappointed with anything I've tried. Highly recommended."},{"business_id":"uJITgt5t7j-KpDChsXPV5w","review_id":"urq3ny3Qj9jtfOe-Z5nLJA","date":"2019-05-28T15:42:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9300960898399353,"text_excerpt":"Terrazu is a super cute spot for lunch in the CBD. If you're wondering, this spot is located inside of the Capital One building at 201 St. Charles Ave. inside of the food court. They serve sandwiches, pastries, coffee and other quick bites. In my opinion, they can serve as your lunchtime spot or your coffee break between work. Clean area, cute aesthetic and great service. I stopped by during the DollarFest that the Ritual \"social ordering\" food app had on last week, since they were offering $1 lunch at participating restaurants around the CBD. The way that this promotion worked is that you chose a $1 lunch meal at a participating restaurant, you ordered and paid for your lunch through the..."},{"business_id":"uJITgt5t7j-KpDChsXPV5w","review_id":"vIr1Ze1sKzU8brJ1rAfZmA","date":"2010-11-12T05:21:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9152213931083679,"text_excerpt":"The silver lining in the cloud that is the CBD. Luckily I'm rarely around here, but Terrazu is a great spot of light in a plcae that is so stark on good food. Especially healthy food options. Great hours, great prices, great staff, and great location if working or attending meetings in CBD. Will be back every time I'm around here for lunch."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"uJITgt5t7j-KpDChsXPV5w","photo_id":"ft99M7GUGP7o5swpW1WeJw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/ft99M7GUGP7o5swpW1WeJw.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
